{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Fall Seeds are a type of ",["l","打造","Crafted"]," seed. The crafting recipe is labeled \"Wild Seeds (Fa)\", but when crafted, the result is \"Fall Seeds.\" Mature plants yield, at random, a ",["l","黑莓","Blackberry"],", ",["l","普通蘑菇","Common Mushroom"],", ",["l","榛子","Hazelnut"],", or ",["l","野梅","Wild Plum"],"."]],["p",["Fall Seeds are one of the season-specific crafted wild seeds, along with ",["l","春季种子","Spring Seeds"],", ",["l","夏季种子","Summer Seeds"],", and ",["l","冬季种子","Winter Seeds"]," that produce crops normally found as ",["l","采集","forage"],". While Farming Skill normally increases the chance to grow a quality crop, Foraging Skill increases the chance to grow a quality crop from Fall Seeds. Choosing the ",["l","技能","Botanist profession"]," will ensure iridium-quality crops grown from Fall Seeds."]],["p",["Crows do not attack crops grown from Fall Seeds, so the use of ",["l","稻草人","Scarecrow"],"s is unnecessary."]]]],["Sources",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","打造","Crafting"]," (each recipe produces 10 Fall Seeds)"]],[1,["Placing a ",["l","普通蘑菇","Common Mushroom"]," in a ",["l","种子生产器","Seed Maker"]," (yield: 1-3 Fall Seeds)"]],[1,["Completing the Crafts Room (reward: 30 Fall Seeds)"]],[1,[["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," (price 135–1,000g)"]],[1,[["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," on ",["l","周循环","Saturdays"]," in exchange for 2 ",["l","冬季种子","Winter Seeds"]]],[1,[["l","骷髅洞穴","Treasure rooms"]," in the Skull Cavern (5-20 each)"]]]]]],["Crops Harvested",2,[["p",["Each Fall Seed has an equal chance of yielding one of any of the ",["l","农作物","crops"]," shown below."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Item"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Source"]}],[[["i","(O)410","Blackberry"]],["An early-fall treat."],[["l","采集","Fall Foraging"]," • Fall Seeds"]],[[["i","(O)404","Common Mushroom"]],["Slightly nutty, with good texture."],[["l","采集","Fall Foraging"]," • Fall Seeds"]],[[["i","(O)408","Hazelnut"]],["That's one big hazelnut!"],[["l","采集","Fall Foraging"]," • 